oint-six-billion desperate businessmen white knuckling automatic weapons. Finger on the trigger, backed into a wet corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So now, It\u2019s dead, and the world goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cities of man are built on modern ruins. Peaking above a sea of the world\u2019s most powerful drain cleaner are the last bits of civilization. Mankind floats on green water, and every other shaky breath draws in a mouthful of some chemical cocktail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s no one hiring in heaven. There\u2019s been some re-org, new management, and a series of layoffs numbering in the trillions. Imagine a production line manned entirely by two million meat-based entities that exist sharing one soul. That\u2019s you. How economic! The world is saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what else is there to do now, but to each, individually, make one billion dollars? I don\u2019t know. Why do angels pay rent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Port St. Love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159750/extras/af58d75b4e510978408a7746d2bd901d.poster.avif?t=1772487742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159750/extras/af58d75b4e510978408a7746d2bd901d.webm?t=1772487742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159750/extras/af58d75b4e510978408a7746d2bd901d.mp4?t=1772487742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159750/extras/055844c118bd105db4a1980a63c1b922.avif?t=1772487742\" width=700 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn